10
01:05:20,000 --> 01:05:26,000
Blackthorn is a 2011 Western film directed by Mateo Gil and
starring Sam Shepard, Eduardo Noriega, and Stephen Rea.

11
01:11:52,000 --> 01:11:58,000
Written by Miguel Barros, the film is a fictional account of an aged Butch Cassidy living under the assumed
name James Blackthorn in a secluded village in Bolivia 20 years after his disappearance in 1908.

12
01:18:24,000 --> 01:18:30,000
Blackthorn was filmed on location in La Paz, Potosí, and Uyuni in Bolivia.

13
01:24:56,000 --> 01:25:02,000
Initially released in Spain on 1 July 2011, the film was released
theatrically in the United States on 7 October 2011.

14
01:31:28,000 --> 01:31:34,000
The film explores themes of robbery, miner,
treachery, sundance kid, native peoples.
